# Cursor already skips everything in .gitignore (node_modules, dist, release,
# coverage, .metrics, test-results, playwright-report) and its default list
# (lockfiles, *.png, *.webp, fonts, archives). This file only adds tracked
# files that are noise for the agent. It is a hard block: ignored files can't
# be read or @-mentioned, so keep it short.

# Vendored Python quality tools: run them via npm scripts, never edit or read.
tools/quality/crapper/
tools/quality/dryer/
tools/quality/mutator/

# Binary app icons
src/openMarket/user_interface/resources/*.icns
src/openMarket/user_interface/resources/*.ico
src/openMarket/user_interface/app.icns

# Optional: finished redesign plans (~43k tokens). They are never loaded
# automatically; this only hides them from grep. Uncomment to block them,
# delete the line again when you want to @-mention one.
# docs/design/plans/
